Derived material in this repository:
  * crates/reach-channels/src/registry.rs — the 14-channel / 40-action catalog
    (names, help strings, params, defaults, backend ordering, public-web
    scopes, per-action timeouts), transcribed from agent_reach/channels/*.py.
  * crates/reach-channels/src/{web,v2ex,github,xueqiu,bilibili}.rs — ports of
    the corresponding channels' native HTTP backends, including their parsing
    rules, error mapping and safety limits.
  * crates/reach-channels/src/{urlsec,params}.rs — ports of
    agent_reach/utils/{url,text}.py security and shaping helpers.
  * schema.json — the result envelope contract, recorded from the Python build.
  * tests/golden/* — output recorded from the Python build (see
    scripts/record_contract.py and tests/golden/manifest.json for provenance).

