arana does not vendor or link obscura. It installs the pinned release binary
on demand (crates/reach-tools/src/obscura.rs) and drives it as a child process
for self-hosted page reads. If arana binaries are ever redistributed together
with obscura, obscura's LICENSE and NOTICE must ship alongside them and the
pinned version must be stated:

