--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
arana talks to public endpoints operated by GitHub, V2EX, Xueqiu, Tencent,
Bilibili, Exa, Jina and others. No content from those services is bundled here;
all requests are made by the user's own installation under those services'
terms. arana is read-only and stores no credentials beyond what the user
configures.
